  "translationNotes": [
    "Published fixtures, request bodies, warning ordering, state lifecycle, usage and TC3 reference signatures are retained.",
    "JavaScript byte arrays and base64 string file data become Foundation Data; response headers are compared through the native metadata wrapper.",
    "Native VideoGenerationRequest requires a prompt string. Empty string represents upstream absent prompt and is omitted in Tencent builders.",
    "Each TokenHub/VOD output has a VideoURLDescriptor preserving its URL/MIME association; the native mixed-format supplement verifies MOV,WebM,MP4 fallback and last-frame exclusion without changing raw/metadata results."
  ],
